src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973100/extras/8cf5bf7367f95d604bf750ff64a8c8cc.webm?t=1749202413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973100/extras/8cf5bf7367f95d604bf750ff64a8c8cc.mp4?t=1749202413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each fighter ship has unique specs including health, shield, speed, and weapon damage. They are equipped with an active shield that can block enemy attacks with right timing - its effective use depends on using it at the right moment. The weapons inflict distinct damage to both health and shield of the fighters. Choose your weapon wisely, as the shield halves the damage inflicted to health. You can find many kinds of power-ups like time control, the shockwave and the nuke in the maps and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973100/extras/c616b5f8eae6b3fb18cad0f9094e5160.poster.avif?t=1749202413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973100/extras/c616b5f8eae6b3fb18cad0f9094e5160.webm?t=1749202413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973100/extras/c616b5f8eae6b3fb18cad0f9094e5160.mp4?t=1749202413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Music by Alexey Kasyanchuk (DEgITx) (CC license)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
